: architecture, Design & Build, branding, furniture and technology, all through our own teams. Targeting SKA Gold, Fitwel 2 Star and EPC A, fully decarbonised and part powered by renewable electricity. What we build for clients, applied to ourselves."]]]]]],["div",{"className":"lg:py-[42px] bg-warm-white"},["section",{"className":"project-landscape-image mx-auto max-w-[1888px] py-1 lg:py-2"},["div",{"className":"aspect-[16/9] relative mx-2 overflow-hidden rounded-xs lg:mx-4 lg:aspect-[1408/792]"},["picture",{"className":"site-image cover"},["img",{"src":"/media/www_219766_1786119717-260709-st-johns-st-42-cb2de5.avif","alt":"","loading":"lazy","style":{"backgroundImage":"url(\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\")","backgroundSize":"cover","backgroundRepeat":"no-repeat","backgroundPosition":"50% 50%","color":"transparent","aspectRatio":"1408 / 792","width":"100%","maxWidth":"1408px","height":"auto","--object-position":"50% 50%"},"referrerPolicy":"no-referrer-when-downgrade"}]]]]],["div",{"className":"lg:py-[42px] bg-warm-white"},["section",{"className":"project-text-block py-8 lg:py-16"},["div",{"className":"container site-grid"},["div",{"className":"col-span-full lg:col-span-6 xl:col-span-11"},["h2",{"className":"mb-8 whitespace-pre-line lg:mb-0 font-sans text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em] cap-trim lg:text-[32px] lg:tracking-[-0.06em]"},"An exceptional space, exceptionally made."]],["div",{"className":"col-span-full lg:col-span-6 xl:col-span-12 xl:col-start-13"},["div",{"className":"wysiwyg wysiwyg-flow body [&>h2,&>h3,&>h4,&>h5]:h7 [&>p+h2,&>p+h3,&>p+h4,&>p+h5]:mt-16"},["p",0,"This is an office built around the people who use it, every day. A gym and changing facilities on the ground floor. A roof terrace planted with lavender, thyme and rosemary, built as a genuine social destination, not spare space. Tea points, breakout areas and natural daylight on every floor, with air quality tested after completion, not just promised on paper. Add over 80 bespoke 